      "decision": "Skip breadcrumbs; add a small `<BackLink>` component to be used on sub-views that have a clear parent. Sub-view list for this round: StudentResults exam-detail mode (already has a back button — formalize it), PracticeAuthoring (Lecturer parent), and Practice (Student parent). Do NOT add to top-level role homes (/student, /lecturer, /admin).",
