m\" inline invert /> {{ saving ? 'Saving' : 'Save' }}</button>\n```\n\nACCESSIBILITY:\n  - `role=\"status\"` + `aria-label` exposes the loading state to AT.\n  - `prefers-reduced-motion` disables rotation and keeps a static square (still visually 'present', just not animated).\n\nNON-GOALS:\n  - No determinate progress bar (no API supplies progress percent).\n  - No `<Button :loading>` wrapper. Future round if button markup is consolidated.\n  - No spinner overlays (full-screen). Skeleton + inline spinner is enough."
