      "decision": "Add a `useAutosave(key, valueRef, options)` composable for localStorage-backed draft persistence on long textareas. Apply to LecturerView's question.requirement textarea and PracticeAuthoring's form.requirement textarea. Do NOT apply to SQL editors (transient quiz answers) or to short single-line inputs.",
