      "design_notes": "NEW FILE `frontend/src/utils/format_date.ts`:\n```ts\nconst DT_FMT = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US', {\n  year: 'numeric', month: 'short', day: '2-digit',\n  hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit', hour12: false,\n})\nconst RT_FMT = new Intl.RelativeTimeFormat('en-US', { numeric: 'auto' })\n\nexport function formatDate(iso: string | null | undefined): string {\n  if (!iso) return '—'\n  const d = new Date(iso)\n  if (isNaN(d.getTime())) return '—'\n  return DT_FMT.format(d)\n}\n\nexport function formatRelative(iso: string | null | undefined, now: Date = new Date()): string {\n  if (!iso) return ''\n  const d = new Date(iso)\n  if (isNaN(d.getTime())) return ''\n  const diffSec = Math.round((d.getTime() - now.getTime()) / 1000)\n  const abs = Math.abs(diffSec)\n  if (abs < 60)    return RT_FMT.format(diffSec, 'second')\n  if (abs < 3600)  return RT_FMT.format(Math.round(diffSec/60), 'minute')\n  if (abs < 86400) return RT_FMT.format(Math.round(diffSec/3600), 'hour')\n  if (abs < 604800)return RT_FMT.format(Math.round(diffSec/86400), 'day')\n  return DT_FMT.format(d) // fall back to absolute for >7 days\n}\n```\nReplace inline `formatDate` definitions in StudentResults.vue (line ~123) and PracticeView.vue (line ~121). In templates render as:\n```html\n<span :title=\"new Date(submittedAt).toISOString()\">\n  {{ formatDate(submittedAt) }} <span class=\"muted small\">({{ formatRelative(submittedAt) }})</span>\n</span>\n```\nVitest: `frontend/src/__tests__/utils/format_date.test.ts` — pin `now`, assert 'in 30 seconds', '2 hours ago', invalid input returns '—'/''.\n\nThis ARCH entry ALSO addresses the related QUICK-FIX item 'Replace .toLocaleString() with explicit Intl.DateTimeFormat' (see ARCH-031).\n\ndone_when: No remaining `.toLocaleString(` call sites in `frontend/src/components/*.vue`; all timestamp cells in StudentResults and PracticeView show absolute + relative; hovering yields a precise ISO tooltip.",
